The NPA `physical-ai-data-factory` skill and the blueprint it documents
(`npa/workflows/workbench/npa-workflows/physical-ai-data-factory.yaml`) are an
NPA-native re-implementation on Nebius + SkyPilot of the NVIDIA Physical AI Data
Factory / Video Data Augmentation workflow. The design analysis was adapted from
NVIDIA agent skills:

  https://github.com/NVIDIA/skills
  - skills/physical-ai-video-data-augmentation   (License: CC-BY-4.0 AND Apache-2.0)
  - skills/physical-ai-infrastructure-setup-and-resilient-scaling (Apache-2.0)
  - skills/physical-ai-neural-reconstruction     (Apache-2.0)
  - skills/physical-ai-defect-image-generation   (CC-BY-4.0 AND Apache-2.0)

The NPA `neural-reconstruction` skill and the capability it documents
(`npa/src/npa/workbench/nurec/`, `npa/src/npa/cli/nurec/`,
`npa/src/npa/workbench/nurec/examples/nurec-reconstruct.yaml`) drive NVIDIA's public
NuRec / Neural Reconstruction Engine containers and public PhysicalAI datasets
from Nebius infrastructure. The recipe knowledge was adapted from the NVIDIA
Omniverse NuRec agent skills and the NVIDIA NCore data library:

  https://github.com/NVIDIA/nurec-skills   (License: Apache-2.0 AND CC-BY-4.0)
  - skills/nre
  - skills/ncore
  - skills/physical-ai-datasets
  https://github.com/NVIDIA/ncore          (License: Apache-2.0)
  - tools/data_converter/colmap
  https://github.com/NVIDIA/skills         (License: Apache-2.0)
  - skills/physical-ai-neural-reconstruction, pinned at commit 0122ea0
    (2026-08-01). The NuRec router skill. Its capability picker table, its
    easy-mix-ups list, its safe secret-verification pattern, and several
    troubleshooting rows were adapted into
    skills/workflows/neural-reconstruction/SKILL.md. Upstream is a router that
    executes nothing and defers to sibling skills; the NPA skill is the
    workbench implementation, so the picker is re-pointed at real
    `npa workbench nurec` verbs and rows NPA does not implement are marked as
    upstream-owned rather than reproduced.

NPA does not redistribute NVIDIA source, container images, or model weights. NRE
runs from the public NGC `-ga` repositories with the operator's own NGC API key.

NPA does not use NVIDIA OSMO. The upstream skills orchestrate on OSMO; the NPA
skills orchestrate on SkyPilot and compose existing NPA workbench tools. The
NPA-native `physical-ai-data-factory` and `neural-reconstruction` capabilities are
shipped as live skills; the remaining capabilities stay design/roadmap in
`docs/architecture/partner-skills-roadmap.md` until they land on Nebius +
SkyPilot with tests.

